# Line endings: LF in the repository and the working tree, so a checkout on any
# platform produces the same bytes. Windows batch files and Visual Studio
# project files keep CRLF; vendored third-party code is never normalised.
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true mixes CRLF working copies with LF blobs and
# every git command prints "LF will be replaced by CRLF".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj.filters text eol=crlf
GBFR.SigilLoadout.Native/third_party/** -text

# Binary assets (never normalised)
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.xlsx binary
*.db binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary
*.lib binary
*.exp binary
*.obj binary
*.iobj binary
*.ipdb binary
*.woff2 binary

# 字节级往返的夹具：这几个文件的**字节就是测试数据**（XML 里是 CRLF，见 actiontracks_test.go 的
# TestTrackRoundTripIsByteExact）。按上面那条 `* text=auto eol=lf` 会被规范化成 LF，
# 别的机器一检出夹具就变样、往返测试必挂 —— 所以这里显式关掉行尾转换。
SigilLoadout/service/testdata/** -text
